<div style="font-family: sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #374151;">
  <h2 style="color: #111827;">Support Team,</h2>
  <p>A new order for a <strong>Colt USA eSIM</strong> has been placed and requires manual fulfillment.</p>
  
  <div style="background: #F3F4F6; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0;">
    <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>Order Number:</strong> #<%= @order.order_number %></p>
    <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0;"><strong>Customer:</strong> <%= @owner.email %></p>
    <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0;"><strong>Quantity:</strong> <%= @order.quantity %></p>
  </div>

  <p>Please process this order and update the credentials in the admin panel within the next 24-48 hours.</p>
  
  <p style="margin-top: 30px; border-top: 1px solid #E5E7EB; padding-top: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: #6B7280;">
    This is an automated system alert.
  </p>
</div>
